#N Gosper Glider Gun
#C The first known gun. Period 30, fires SE-bound gliders.
#C Discovered by Bill Gosper in November 1970 — earned a $50 prize from Conway,
#C and proved Life supports unbounded population growth, a key step toward
#C demonstrating Turing-completeness.
